  "finding": "toml4j 0.7.2 implements TOML 0.4.0. The primary control parses to the expected typed tree, but Toml.read rejects the second control at the hexadecimal integer (line 6, hex = 0xDEAD_BEEF). Its DateValueReaderWriter regex also requires a Z or +hh:mm offset and returns java.util.Date, so the local date-time, local date and local time of that control are outside the API as well. It cannot verify the fixed second control and stays a lead."
